{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814340/extras/a9215f587f184a44f523e5d69f328545.avif?t=1765309636\" width=621 height=301 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through a wasteland filled with rogue AI tanks that seek your destruction. Use clever strategies to destroy them before they destroy you, then lay claim to their parts to build the ultimate vehicle of destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring an in depth damage and projectile system, you will be rewarded for precise shooting and learning your opponents weak spots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Loot!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trawl the wasteland for the scrap of the old world, and fight through hazardous environments to find the tools you need to survive and give yourself an edge in every battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814340/extras/4708dcf73974e5c358834eadca334219.avif?t=1765309636\" width=621 height=301 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match increasingly powerful gear scavenged from the wasteland to build a Franken-tank of looted parts. Separately upgrade your CPU by cannibalising the mind of your opponents to gain the ultimate edge in the final survival of the fittest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814340/extras/90fa098ce7db4c44221dec003772d4a1.avif?t=1765309636\" width=621 height=301 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The wasteland is a procedurally generated world of devastated environments. Each new biome provides a unique challenge for your vehicle. Master each to maintain the strategic advantage at all times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814340/extras/4ff6c81f8f9c3dd6fd049e6cce30ca28.avif?t=1765309636\" width=616 height=298 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight difficult bosses that challenge your build and tactics to become the dominant AI in the wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to the scrapyard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814340/7455edd9d236c2e7cd7fde50eb4a64a85659c519.jpg"},{"name":"Another 10 bite the dust","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814340/7455edd9d236c2e7cd7fde50eb4a64a85659c519.jpg"},{"name":"The Geneva suggestion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814340/7455edd9d236c2e7cd7fde50eb4a64a85659c519.jpg"},{"name":"Improvements all around","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814340/7455edd9d236c2e7cd7fde50eb4a64a85659c519.jpg"},{"name":"She\u2019s a fixer upper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814340/7455edd9d236c2e7cd7fde50eb4a64a85659c519.jpg"},{"name":"Heavyweight","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814340/7455edd9d236c2e7cd7fde50eb4a64a85659c519.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat Scraptor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814340/794b5e0f7db9afb9491cb3652fc7c9178cf9ac68.jpg"},{"name":"One bot\u2019s scrap\u2026","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steams