in the strategic advantage at all times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814340/extras/4ff6c81f8f9c3dd6fd049e6cce30ca28.avif?t=1765309636\" width=616 height=298 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight difficult bosses that challenge your build and tactics to become the dominant AI in the wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Landship Games LTD"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814340/79b51666948f09aa12746ef4ae96fa8a9b0d72b2/header.jpg?t=1765309636","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3814340/1827326344/15403d43e3df76214485a0b99e89b501c4ec0dd3/1760636091/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760636598","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3814340/1827326344/15403d43e3df76214485a0b99e89b501c4ec0dd3/1760636091/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760636598","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3814340/1827326344/15403d43e3df76214485a0b99e89b501c4ec0dd3/1760636091/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760636598","id":257218898,"name":"Tankenstein Teaser 2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257218898/66bc5cec8d38681926a86aea4d57f7e7652c90fd/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760636598"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store